<div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div><a class="upload-image ui-draggable" href="#"><img width="100%" height="" class="img-responsive" alt="" src="/uploads/images/2914ad009ffdc7376a390928090a217c.jpg"></a></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><h4 class="editing note-air-editor note-editable panel-body" id="note-editor-1" style="padding: 15px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體;"><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; CP值最高的碳纖布搭配最高級的編織法讓竿子堅固耐用,黑色俐落的風格, 具有慢搖鐵板竿必備全條件.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 最近流行的天亞也有人會使用因為長度夠長腰身有力敏竿度又非常足夠,負重又比一般天亞竿更為優秀,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 各種風格的竿款上展現不同的釣趣,創新的進化永無止盡.</p></h4></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p><br></p><p><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-filename="BDSJ-B系列7.jpg" style="width: 1134.73px; height: 230.172px;"><br></p></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div>